## ⚙️ Summary
- Update BIOS and enable virtualization (VT-d / AMD-Vi, IOMMU, SR-IOV).  
- Disable legacy boot and enable UEFI-only mode.  
- Run thermal and SMART checks to verify system stability.  
- Confirm all cooling, fans, and PSU are stable before Stage 1.

✅ **Next:** Proceed to [../GRUB](../GRUB) for optional dual-boot setup.

